<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Our Story | REVIVO</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/user/header') %>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8 md:mb-12 text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Story</h1>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <img src="/Images/about-hero.jpg" alt="REVIVO Brand Story" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-md mb-8">
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Reviving Fashion, Respecting Heritage</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Founded in 2018, REVIVO was born from a simple yet powerful idea: to bridge the gap between timeless fashion heritage and contemporary style needs. Our journey began when our founder, while searching through vintage clothing stores, realized the incredible craftsmanship and design of past decades could be reimagined for today's fashion-conscious consumer.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        The name "REVIVO" embodies our mission – to revive and breathe new life into classic designs while creating something entirely fresh and relevant. We're not just about nostalgia; we're about honoring the best elements of fashion history and evolving them for the modern wardrobe.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Philosophy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          At REVIVO, we believe that great style transcends time. Our collections are carefully curated to balance vintage inspiration with contemporary relevance, creating pieces that feel both familiar and fresh.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We're committed to thoughtful design, quality craftsmanship, and responsible production. Each REVIVO piece is created to be treasured and worn for years, not seasons.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/Images/about-philosophy.jpg" alt="REVIVO Philosophy" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-md">
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
        <img src="/Images/about-craftsmanship.jpg" alt="REVIVO Craftsmanship" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-md">
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Craftsmanship & Quality</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          We partner with skilled artisans and ethical manufacturers who share our commitment to excellence. From fabric selection to final stitching, every detail matters.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our quality control standards ensure that each REVIVO piece meets our exacting requirements for durability, comfort, and style – creating garments that improve with age and wear.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Collections</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-[#2C2C2C]">Prime Layers</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Our signature collection focuses on essential layering pieces with a vintage twist. Timeless silhouettes reimagined with modern fabrics and subtle details.
          </p>
          <a href="/shop/collection/prime-layers" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Explore Collection →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-[#2C2C2C]">Vintage Athletics</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Inspired by the golden age of sportswear, this collection blends athletic heritage with contemporary street style for everyday versatility.
          </p>
          <a href="/shop/collection/vintage-athletics" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Explore Collection →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-[#2C2C2C]">Y2K Essentials</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            A playful nod to the early 2000s, reinterpreted with a refined aesthetic and improved quality for today's fashion landscape.
          </p>
          <a href="/shop/collection/y2k-essentials" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Explore Collection →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Join Our Journey</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We're building more than a brand – we're creating a community that celebrates the intersection of fashion heritage and modern style. We invite you to be part of our story.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/shop" class="bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-black transition duration-300">Shop Collection</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="border border-[#2C2C2C] text-[#2C2C2C] px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
